        <div><a name="_chinese" id="_chinese"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.8 Chinese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b7a9a4f1-5ba3-4d10-b16c-315048a04ba1" id="_b7a9a4f1-5ba3-4d10-b16c-315048a04ba1"></a>Chinese personal names are names used by those from mainland China, Hong Kong,
Macau, Taiwan, and the Chinese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_325aaecc-d711-4a94-b3a1-a313e603fcaf" id="_325aaecc-d711-4a94-b3a1-a313e603fcaf"></a>Chinese names consist of a
family name (&#x59D3;, x&#xEC;ng), followed by
a given name (&#x540D;, m&#xED;ng).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_57b4524d-48d2-42aa-8a94-ba03880cf048" id="_57b4524d-48d2-42aa-8a94-ba03880cf048"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo19;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo19;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2b901145-3295-416b-a513-cd65ac71b9d3" id="_2b901145-3295-416b-a513-cd65ac71b9d3"></a>Some people also utilize a &#x201C;courtesy name&#x201D; or &#x201C;style name&#x201D; (&#x5B57;, z&#xEC;),
by which they were known among those outside their
family and closest friends.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_representations" id="_typical_name_representations"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.8.1 Typical name representations</p><div class="example"><a name="_c9f3124a-0fe0-4f62-81ee-da1e11b6e7eb" id="_c9f3124a-0fe0-4f62-81ee-da1e11b6e7eb"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x6587;&#x201D; (Sun Man), the birth name of the founding father
of the Republic of China &#x201C;Sun Yat-sen&#x201D;:</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.1</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_f5cebcbb-ca15-462a-8631-55005b5217c8" id="_f5cebcbb-ca15-462a-8631-55005b5217c8"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x6587;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_c38bd9f7-db00-4062-aa0f-82e961b429be" id="_c38bd9f7-db00-4062-aa0f-82e961b429be"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x5FB7;&#x660E;&#x201D; (Sun De Ming), the genealogical name (&#x8B5C;&#x540D;):</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.2</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_4a42fdfe-2983-4c3e-b2cb-1cdd5e5a8178" id="_4a42fdfe-2983-4c3e-b2cb-1cdd5e5a8178"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5FB7;&#x660E;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
