</div>
        <div><a name="_manchu" id="_manchu"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.30 Manchu</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ff932a3c-6640-4621-a2cb-2ebf12fc94ab" id="_ff932a3c-6640-4621-a2cb-2ebf12fc94ab"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_eea6541d-4ce0-4ab5-a8e9-23a4b140eb53" id="_eea6541d-4ce0-4ab5-a8e9-23a4b140eb53"></a>Manchus are called only by their given names.
Manchu clan names (&#x201C;hala&#x201D;) are not used with their personal names,
but occasionally a family name is used.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_10" id="_typical_name_patterns_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.30.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.40</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_e6f343fd-ecf4-4fca-af22-8843fa3a3757" id="_e6f343fd-ecf4-4fca-af22-8843fa3a3757"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.41</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_4ab3c560-c083-47b3-8165-11a37e47f8d0" id="_4ab3c560-c083-47b3-8165-11a37e47f8d0"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.42</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_38d4861a-77c5-4c19-a044-21ba8d43f3f8" id="_38d4861a-77c5-4c19-a044-21ba8d43f3f8"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_10" id="_examples_10"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.30.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_dc065ccf-2c17-45b6-8ea3-de1a5aa4ff44" id="_dc065ccf-2c17-45b6-8ea3-de1a5aa4ff44"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Tuli&#x161;en&#x201D;</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_37288c78-873f-42c5-b49a-e53ecc518bfb" id="_37288c78-873f-42c5-b49a-e53ecc518bfb"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Hiowan Ye&#x201D; (&#x7384;&#x70E8;)</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_87068343-83f3-488d-91ed-b895ff7a1cce" id="_87068343-83f3-488d-91ed-b895ff7a1cce"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  3</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Aisin-Gioro Ulhicun&#x201D;, linguist. The family name is &#x201C;Aisin-Gioro&#x201D;.</p></div></div></div>
        <div><a name="_mongolian" id="_mongolian"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.31 Mongolian</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_64fb90df-5d9b-4d49-b5cc-aea238dce537" id="_64fb90df-5d9b-4d49-b5cc-aea238dce537"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    clan name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo35;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    genonymic name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d5720973-3ed9-46a4-96ba-54ff9e0ce61d" id="_d5720973-3ed9-46a4-96ba-54ff9e0ce61d"></a>Mongolian names traditionally consists of only one personal name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_11" id="_typical_name_patterns_11"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.31.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.43</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_d50eed90-edf8-4f7b-a62a-e4566773b6d4" id="_d50eed90-edf8-4f7b-a62a-e4566773b6d4"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">clan name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.44</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_ff2adf09-b97d-4139-8cc8-b4988d59cb15" id="_ff2adf09-b97d-4139-8cc8-b4988d59cb15"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.45</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_3694c199-8ad2-4f83-8b0d-852f17215516" id="_3694c199-8ad2-4f83-8b0d-852f17215516"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">genonymic name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_11" id="_examples_11"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.31.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_fc5ac518-b35e-468f-be96-083f56e5b436" id="_fc5ac518-b35e-468f-be96-083f56e5b436"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x41E;&#x442;&#x440;&#x44F;&#x434;&#x44B;&#x43D; &#x413;&#x4AF;&#x43D;&#x434;&#x44D;&#x433;&#x43C;&#x430;&#x430; (&#x201C;Otryadyn G&#xFC;ndegmaa&#x201D;), a Mongolian shooter, has &#x201C;Otryadyn&#x201D; as a patronym, &#x201C;G&#xFC;ndegmaa&#x201D; as given name.</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_5bad164f-05b1-41e4-8fb7-be8d65028287" id="_5bad164f-05b1-41e4-8fb7-be8d65028287"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x425;&#x430;&#x43B;&#x442;&#x43C;&#x430;&#x430;&#x433;&#x438;&#x439;&#x43D; &#x411;&#x430;&#x442;&#x442;&#x443;&#x43B;&#x433;&#x430; (&#x201C;Khaltmaagiin Battulga&#x201D;), President of Mongolia.</p></div></div></div>
