<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_96a9ff6e-c958-4939-a168-b089f4ea2366" id="_96a9ff6e-c958-4939-a168-b089f4ea2366"></a>Portuguese often have two personal names, although the first may at times be used on its own.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_12" id="_typical_name_patterns_12"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.35.1 Typical name patterns</p>

  <p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.46</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_fd5f7456-c587-4247-9268-424f0d93c582" id="_fd5f7456-c587-4247-9268-424f0d93c582"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">mother&#x2019;s patronymic name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">father&#x2019;s patronymic name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div><a name="_examples_12" id="_examples_12"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.35.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_8ddb965d-6634-4dc7-b591-76d00596778d" id="_8ddb965d-6634-4dc7-b591-76d00596778d"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>George Agostinho Baptista da Silva</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_f68c1c9a-5593-4707-bc4f-7e69b8f24341" id="_f68c1c9a-5593-4707-bc4f-7e69b8f24341"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Ant&#xF3;nio Caetano de Abreu Freire Egas Moniz&#x201D;, Nobel prize winner. He was the
child of &#x201C;Fernando de Pina Rezende Abreu&#x201D; and &#x201C;Maria do Rosario de Almeida e Sousa&#x201D;.</p></div></div></div>
