        <div><a name="_thai" id="_thai"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.45 Thai</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_cfa6584f-bc61-439d-9d36-8c393c73c117" id="_cfa6584f-bc61-439d-9d36-8c393c73c117"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo39;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo39;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2ac2ca16-6589-45f6-adfe-b226fd1b7034" id="_2ac2ca16-6589-45f6-adfe-b226fd1b7034"></a>Modern Thai names are composed of given names followed by the family name.
Prior to 1913, family names were not required.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_15" id="_typical_name_patterns_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.45.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.49</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_d36144ff-0890-4ac9-98a6-27969e215a82" id="_d36144ff-0890-4ac9-98a6-27969e215a82"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.50</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_4147d6ab-2bc9-4bbf-aca1-9c1c4919009d" id="_4147d6ab-2bc9-4bbf-aca1-9c1c4919009d"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div><a name="_examples_15" id="_examples_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.45.2 Examples</p>

  <div class="example"><a name="_769eb690-312f-4c47-b817-18a57606dedf" id="_769eb690-312f-4c47-b817-18a57606dedf"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#xE0A;&#xE27;&#xE19; &#xE2B;&#xE25;&#xE35;&#xE01;&#xE20;&#xE31;&#xE22; (&#x201C;Chuan Likphai&#x201D;)</p></div>
</div></div>
        <div><a name="_turkish" id="_turkish"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.46 Turkish</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_ukrainian" id="_ukrainian"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.47 Ukrainian</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_vietnamese" id="_vietnamese"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.48 Vietnamese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_cb90d722-3bc1-4cb6-bf1e-c530e7edaef5" id="_cb90d722-3bc1-4cb6-bf1e-c530e7edaef5"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo40;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo40;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    additional name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo40;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    family name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6e7aeba0-04ec-4e17-9241-3666dc4d7a01" id="_6e7aeba0-04ec-4e17-9241-3666dc4d7a01"></a>Vietnamese personal names are names used by those from Vietnam and the
Vietnamese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1cd1eed1-6b7b-4eba-bff7-e43881e10c93" id="_1cd1eed1-6b7b-4eba-bff7-e43881e10c93"></a>Vietnamese names consist of a family name (T&#xEA;n, &#x20E1B;),
followed by a given name (H&#x1ECD;, /&#x22A5C;).
Between the family name and given name,
one or more additional names may be present.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b7cdb364-9e86-4b23-98fb-df99e06f82df" id="_b7cdb364-9e86-4b23-98fb-df99e06f82df"></a>Vietnamese additional names can be a
middle name (t&#xEA;n &#x111;&#x1EC7;m),
generational name,
or clan distinguisher name. The middle name, for identification purposes, can be omitted.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2b809041-3594-475c-ba4c-57800b614c1f" id="_2b809041-3594-475c-ba4c-57800b614c1f"></a>Courtesy names are also allowed, separate from the given name.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_16" id="_typical_name_patterns_16"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.48.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.51</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_1b45d836-f5be-4c98-8041-e99acc9de380" id="_1b45d836-f5be-4c98-8041-e99acc9de380"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.52</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_8f68d955-4f12-4377-aa73-66657e69fa11" id="_8f68d955-4f12-4377-aa73-66657e69fa11"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table B.53</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_8ea02c48-1eab-4975-9436-0ed707b4151e" id="_8ea02c48-1eab-4975-9436-0ed707b4151e"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">additonal name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
